    <masterLabel>VAT Claim details</masterLabel>
    <promptVersions>
        <actionButtonLabel>Approval Requests</actionButtonLabel>
        <actionButtonLink>https://intel--crmdevccp.lightning.force.com/lightning/o/ProcessInstanceWorkitem/list?filterName=00Bo0000002lSkWEAU</actionButtonLink>
        <body>&lt;p&gt;1.How to identify Claim is Eligible for VAT?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Once claim is created for UK country, on claim detail page you can see &apos;VAT hold&apos; checkbox for VAT eligible claim&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://intel--CRMDEVCCP--c.documentforce.com/servlet/rtaImage?refid=0EMg0000000qBXP&quot; alt=&quot;image.png&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;2.How to Navigate to VAT Record?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Goto related section of claim , you will find VAT section.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://intel--CRMDEVCCP--c.documentforce.com/servlet/rtaImage?refid=0EMg0000000qBXZ&quot; alt=&quot;image.png&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;3.Where to find the Pending VAT Approvals&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;. Click on below &apos;Approval Request&apos; Button&lt;/p&gt;</body>
        <customApplication>Core_MDF_CoMarketing</customApplication>
